{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母の日にはお母さんに\n黒い柴犬のぬいぐるみをあげました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうどぎゅとするのにいい大きさで\nいい柔らかさで可愛いんだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらダックスはなかった...\nでもお母さんはとても喜んでくれました。\n少しでも寂しさが和らぎますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/15/5685340/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュースおいし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリーンスムージーも\nバナナジュースも\nオレンジ×パイナップルジュースも\n全部好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュースに関しては好き嫌いがない私です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物も！！\nあんまり無いですよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ餡子黒蜜きな粉が苦手...\nあと焼きとうもろこし...\nあと生玉ねぎと生ネギ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外とあったね(　˙-˙　)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/15/5685340/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/15/5685340/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちら。ちゅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/15/5685340/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、あげる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/15/5685340/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりダメ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4コマ漫画風でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から漫画大好きっ子です\n少女漫画が好きですが\n最近は少年漫画も好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}